, shifting from a https://t.co/BMcBMZ9pV1", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceMagazine/status/2118257767702020587"}, {"author_id": "14499829", "created_at": "2026-11-05T08:20:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118257058386522607"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ldCStqdLlO", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/WHO/status/2118257058386522607/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118257054993252352", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/ldCStqdLlO"}]}, "id": "2118257058386522607", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 28297, "like_count": 52, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 20}, "text": "28% of adolescent girls report no active days in the previous week, compared with 22% of boys.  \n\nOnly 11% of girls report seven active days, versus 17% of boys.  \n\nThis gap is not about girls’ interests or ability.   \n\nSafer spaces, inclusive sport and recreation, and supportive https://t.co/ldCStqdLlO", "url": "https://x.com/WHO/status/2118257058386522607"}, {"author_id": "28164923", "created_at": "2026-11-05T07:50:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118249681138430443"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Oil prices were mixed as traders assessed the outlook for U.S.-Iran relations and recovering oil supplies from the Middle East.", "display_url": "on.wsj.com/3V1OpWK", "end": 98, "expanded_url": "https://on.wsj.com/3V1OpWK", "images": [{"height": 640, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118249684669984768/yHTqwNDm?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118249684669984768/yHTqwNDm?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 75, "status": 200, "title": "Oil Prices Stay Below $100 as Traders Weigh Iran Diplomacy, Supply Outlook", "unwound_url": "https://www.wsj.com/business/energy-oil/oil-prices-stay-below-100-as-traders-weigh-iran-diplomacy-supply-outlook-4e8f12e5?reflink=e2twmkts", "url": "https://t.co/oXpTMTmlp1"}]}, "id": "2118249681138430443", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 5456, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Oil Prices Stay Below $100 as Traders Weigh Iran Diplomacy, Supply Outlook https://t.co/oXpTMTmlp1", "url": "https://x.com/WSJmarkets/status/2118249681138430443"}, {"author_id": "28164923", "created_at": "2026-11-05T07:14:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118240599396515986"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Long-end Treasury yields fell to eight-week lows as investors saw relief for bond markets following the Democrat sweep in U.S. midterm elections.", "display_url": "on.wsj.com/3WtzK74", "end": 102, "expanded_url": "https://on.wsj.com/3WtzK74", "images": [{"height": 640, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118240602206658560/b7Y1NOi9?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118240602206658560/b7Y1NOi9?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 79, "status": 200, "title": "U.S. Treasury Yields Fall to Eight-Week Lows as Markets Digest Midterm Results", "unwound_url": "https://www.wsj.com/finance/investing/u-s-treasury-yields-fall-to-eight-week-lows-as-markets-digest-midterm-results-7effce3e?reflink=e2twmkts", "url": "https://t.co/uwplyXKN06"}]}, "id": "2118240599396515986", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 5714, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "U.S. Treasury Yields Fall to Eight-Week Lows as Markets Digest Midterm Results https://t.co/uwplyXKN06", "url": "https://x.com/WSJmarkets/status/2118240599396515986"}, {"author_id": "32372834", "created_at": "2026-11-05T07:00:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118236891006800048"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 250, "id": "248897605", "start": 240, "username": "ScienceTM"}], "urls": [{"description": "CCR8xCD3 bispecific antibody potently boosts antitumor immunity by engaging T cells for the depletion of immunosuppressive intratumoral Treg cells.", "display_url": "scim.ag/4dZ2uL2", "end": 274, "expanded_url": "https://scim.ag/4dZ2uL2", "images": [{"height": 550, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118236938343727104/RUnSnafV?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 715}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118236938343727104/RUnSnafV?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 251, "status": 200, "title": "T cell–mediated depletion of intratumoral regulatory T cells using a CCR8xCD3 T cell–engaging bispecific antibody (TCB) promotes antitumor immunity in preclinical mouse models", "unwound_url": "https://www.science.org/doi/10.1126/scitranslmed.aea7127?utm_campaign=ScienceMagazine&utm_medium=ownedSocial&utm_source=twitter", "url": "https://t.co/YgPRqfZk6X"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/9jfJ2a0TsE", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ScienceMagazine/status/2118236891006800048/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118236889048088576", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/9jfJ2a0TsE"}]}, "id": "2118236891006800048", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 11504, "like_count": 62, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "A new bispecific antibody targets both CCR8 to deplete regulatory T cells and CD3 to revitalize the broader anti-tumor T cell armada. It combated multiple tumor types and potentiated immunotherapy in mice while being safe in large animals. @ScienceTM https://t.co/YgPRqfZk6X https://t.co/9jfJ2a0TsE", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceMagazine/status/2118236891006800048"}, {"author_id": "32372834", "created_at": "2026-11-05T06:57:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118236123822522855"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 22, "start": 8, "tag": "ClimateChange"}], "mentions": [{"end": 139, "id": "2326120952", "start": 123, "username": "ScienceAdvances"}], "urls": [{"description": "Anthropogenic climate change intensifies extreme precipitation, but how it affects flood hazards remains uncertain. In September 2024, Storm Boris triggered catastrophic flooding across central Europe, underscoring the need to quantify the contribution ...", "display_url": "scim.ag/48lEhLw", "end": 164, "expanded_url": "https://scim.ag/48lEhLw", "images": [{"height": 550, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115911632945553408/Ypk-SfjS?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 715}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115911632945553408/Ypk-SfjS?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 141, "status": 200, "title": "Evidence from 2024 Storm Boris indicates anthropogenic climate change amplifies floods more than extreme precipitation", "unwound_url": "https://www.science.org/doi/10.1126/sciadv.aef7703?utm_campaign=ScienceMagazine&utm_source=twitter&utm_medium=ownedSocial", "url": "https://t.co/Q96Mn6ZmEy"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/1y80n1gv1l", "end": 188, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ScienceMagazine/status/2118236123822522855/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118236121377210368", "start": 165, "url": "https://t.co/1y80n1gv1l"}]}, "id": "2118236123822522855", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 9897, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Without #ClimateChange, flood peaks in Europe from Storm Boris would have been as much as 22% lower, new models suggest in @ScienceAdvances. https://t.co/Q96Mn6ZmEy https://t.co/1y80n1gv1l", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceMagazine/status/2118236123822522855"}, {"author_id": "32372834", "created_at": "2026-11-05T05:05:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118207939794112848"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 180, "start": 161, "tag": "ScienceWorkingLife"}], "urls": [{"description": "This professor changed how he operated after learning some people were irked by his AI assistant", "display_url": "scim.ag/4BPJcC6", "end": 204, "expanded_url": "https://scim.ag/4BPJcC6", "images": [{"height": 804, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116018869638934528/XzbKzX73?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1216}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116018869638934528/XzbKzX73?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 181, "status": 200, "title": "A colleague hated my AI-polished emails—so he set a trap", "unwound_url": "https://www.science.org/content/article/colleague-hated-my-ai-polished-emails-so-he-set-trap?utm_campaign=ScienceMagazine&utm_medium=ownedSocial&utm_source=twitter", "url": "https://t.co/8aztPByQIq"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/uO0ADrEesD", "end": 228, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ScienceMagazine/status/2118207939794112848/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118207936849727488", "start": 205, "url": "https://t.co/uO0ADrEesD"}]}, "id": "2118207939794112848", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 31, "impression_count": 23049, "like_count": 51, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "\"I still find the AI assistant helpful for refining routine correspondence. But I have found it can get in the way of connecting with the people closest to me.\" #ScienceWorkingLife https://t.co/8aztPByQIq https://t.co/uO0ADrEesD", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceMagazine/status/2118207939794112848"}, {"author_id": "32372834", "created_at": "2026-11-05T04:00:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118191591059767738"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 75, "id": "15165502", "start": 66, "username": "NASAMars"}, {"end": 258, "id": "4002564749", "start": 246, "username": "SciRobotics"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/mBZB71bbzo", "end": 283, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ScienceMagazine/status/2118191591059767738/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118191588828463105", "start": 260, "url": "https://t.co/mBZB71bbzo"}]}, "id": "2118191591059767738", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 13031, "like_count": 35, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "Instead of waiting days for its next instructions from Earth, the @NASAMars rover Perseverance now uses an embedded robotic system to monitor its environment and operations, leading to an increase in activity and quality science. \n\nLearn more in @SciRobotics: https://t.co/mBZB71bbzo", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceMagazine/status/2118191591059767738"}, {"author_id": "3290364847", "created_at": "2026-11-05T03:09:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118178884843647148"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Democratic doctors were among the winners in the midterm elections, while the MAHA movement and President Trump's health agenda were losers.", "display_url": "statnews.com/2026/11/04/mid…", "end": 88, "expanded_url": "https://www.statnews.com/2026/11/04/midterm-health-policy-winners-losers-medicare-for-all-rfk-jr/", "images": [{"height": 576, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118000615926169600/4KOxM8q2?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1024}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118000615926169600/4KOxM8q2?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 65, "status": 200, "title": "Five midterm winners and losers: MAHA mowed down, Dem docs scrub in, Medicare for All returns", "unwound_url": "https://www.statnews.com/2026/11/04/midterm-health-policy-winners-losers-medicare-for-all-rfk-jr/", "url": "https://t.co/HCODbLOqlZ"}]}, "id": "2118178884843647148", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2016, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Democratic doctors and scientists made a splash in a ‘STEM wave’ https://t.co/HCODbLOqlZ", "url": "https://x.com/statnews/status/2118178884843647148"}, {"author_id": "32372834", "created_at": "2026-11-05T02:27:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118168176231891442"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/3yYTsk6qWN", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ScienceMagazine/status/2118168176231891442/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118168173652439040", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/3yYTsk6qWN"}]}, "id": "2118168176231891442", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 13060, "like_count": 36, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "Rapid travel across longitudes can induce a form of “jet lag” in wild seabirds, leading them to veer off course as they navigate by the Sun, even when alternative navigational cues are available. The results provide a new avenue for chronobiology research in the wild.\n\nLearn more https://t.co/3yYTsk6qWN", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceMagazine/status/2118168176231891442"}, {"author_id": "28164923", "created_at": "2026-11-05T02:16:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118165433350070328"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Oil continued to fall in early Asian trade after declining over 8% overnight on rising hopes for an end to the Middle East conflict following the Democrats’ sweep in the U.S. midterm elections.", "display_url": "on.wsj.com/4sGpuo5", "end": 79, "expanded_url": "https://on.wsj.com/4sGpuo5", "start": 56, "status": 200, "title": "Oil Continues to Fall Amid Rising Hopes to End Iran War", "unwound_url": "https://www.wsj.com/finance/commodities-futures/oil-continues-to-fall-amid-rising-hopes-to-end-iran-war-7e9ba2fb?reflink=e2twmkts", "url": "https://t.co/2GR0OJ2ycM"}]}, "id": "2118165433350070328", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9635, "like_count": 30, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "Oil Continues to Fall Amid Rising Hopes to End Iran War https://t.co/2GR0OJ2ycM", "url": "https://x.com/WSJmarkets/status/2118165433350070328"}, {"author_id": "207256884", "created_at": "2026-11-05T00:47:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118143164158767207"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The breakthroughs accelerating the growth of California's quantum innovation ecosystem depend on fundamental science and engineering from Caltech and other academic institutions, according to Caltech leaders and researchers who spoke at the statewide Quantum California Convening las